{
 "_doc": [
  "Merged bindings: one native file per installed directory set, exporting every member's PyInit.",
  "Each member keeps its module name; python/mojolearn/_merged.py loads it from the merged file",
  "through the directory's _mojolearn_merged.json index when its own .so is absent.",
  "dirs.<dir>.groups: merged file stem -> members. Adding a binding is one line in its group.",
  "dirs.<dir>.optional: member -> platforms where it joins the group when MOJOLEARN_PACKAGE_BYTE_LM=1.",
  "darwin_metal1: members whose per-binding script passes --target-accelerator metal:1 on macOS;",
  "on macOS they compile into <stem>_m1 so every member keeps its own compile flags.",
  "tools/merged_bindings.py reads this file; bindings/merged_build.sh builds it."
